      "description": "A modest learning desk: open BLANK notebook, a few closed unlettered books, plain pencil and simple desk lamp. Wider third-person environmental viewpoint, no human face or age-specific school equipment. Muted navy surroundings with restrained flat warm lamplight shapes. No writing, equations, certificates, graduation, exam marks, screens or academic success. Large simple shapes that read at small size.",
